      children: "Spring singleton cache: singletonObjects (fully created) -> earlySingletonObjects (exposed but not fully initialized) -> singletonFactories (raw object before post-processing). Constructor injection + circular deps fails → use setter or @Lazy. Best fix: redesign to eliminate circular deps."
